%description:

Tests the PCP steps of the 802.1Q tag inserters (see Ieee8021qTagEpd_pcp_1) in a
node that inserts a C-tag and then an S-tag (IEEE 802.1ad). Both inserters map
the user priority request, which the C-tag inserter leaves on the packet, so
both tags get the user priority unless a PCP request of their own tag type
overrides it. Each inserter that maps its PCP indication overwrites the user
priority indication, so the S-tag inserter, which runs last, wins.

The probe prints the PCP of the outer (S) tag as pcp0 and of the inner (C) tag
as pcp1. The chains:
- a: default parameters; a user priority alone, and with an S-tag PCP request
- b: the S-tag inserter does not map its PCP indication, so the user priority
  indication is the PCP of the C-tag
- c: neither inserter maps its PCP indication; no user priority indication
- d: the C-tag inserter removes the user priority request, so the S-tag gets
  the defaultPcp of its inserter, 2

%file: test.ned

import inet.test.moduletest.lib.PcpTestChain;

network Test
{
    submodules:
        a: PcpTestChain { sTag = true; };
        b: PcpTestChain { sTag = true; };
        c: PcpTestChain { sTag = true; };
        d: PcpTestChain { sTag = true; };
}

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
network = Test
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
sim-time-limit = 3.5s
cmdenv-express-mode = false
cmdenv-event-banners = false
**.cmdenv-log-level = off
*.a.requester.userPriorities = [6, 6]
*.a.requester.sPcps = [-1, 5]
*.b.requester.userPriorities = [6]
*.b.requester.sPcps = [5]
*.b.sInserter.mapPcpIndToUserPriorityInd = false
*.c.requester.userPriorities = [6]
*.c.*Inserter.mapPcpIndToUserPriorityInd = false
*.d.requester.userPriorities = [6]
*.d.cInserter.removeUserPriorityReq = true
*.d.sInserter.defaultPcp = 2

%contains: stdout
a #0: pcp0=6 pcp1=6 UserPriorityReq=6 UserPriorityInd=6 CPcpReq=none SPcpReq=none CPcpInd=6 SPcpInd=6

%contains: stdout
a #1: pcp0=5 pcp1=6 UserPriorityReq=6 UserPriorityInd=5 CPcpReq=none SPcpReq=none CPcpInd=6 SPcpInd=5

%contains: stdout
b #0: pcp0=5 pcp1=6 UserPriorityReq=6 UserPriorityInd=6 CPcpReq=none SPcpReq=none CPcpInd=6 SPcpInd=5

%contains: stdout
c #0: pcp0=6 pcp1=6 UserPriorityReq=6 UserPriorityInd=none CPcpReq=none SPcpReq=none CPcpInd=6 SPcpInd=6

%contains: stdout
d #0: pcp0=2 pcp1=6 UserPriorityReq=none UserPriorityInd=2 CPcpReq=none SPcpReq=none CPcpInd=6 SPcpInd=2
